# Hyperion contract interface capability snapshot.
#
# This file is the reviewed record of one surface's public methods and advertised routes.
# The Rust, Foundry and protocol suites read it; changing the contract without changing
# this file is a failing test. See docs/INTERFACE_CAPABILITIES.md before editing.
surface soroban/cctp-adapter
contract CctpAdapter
status active
